*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Minimal hand-written PPD for testing the cups driver with a ZPL label filter.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LABELZPL.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Generic"
*Product: "(Generic ZPL Label Printer)"
*ModelName: "Generic ZPL Label Printer"
*ShortNickName: "Generic ZPL Label Printer"
*NickName: "Generic ZPL Label Printer, test PPD"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "4"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 18
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.zebra-zpl 50 rastertolabel"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w144h72
*PageSize w144h72/2 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[144 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w288h144/4 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[288 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w288h432/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Label Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w144h72
*PageRegion w144h72/2 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[144 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w288h144/4 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[288 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w288h432/4 x 6 in: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w144h72
*ImageableArea w144h72/2 x 1 in: "0 0 144 72"
*ImageableArea w288h144/4 x 2 in: "0 0 288 144"
*ImageableArea w288h432/4 x 6 in: "0 0 288 432"
*DefaultPaperDimension: w144h72
*PaperDimension w144h72/2 x 1 in: "144 72"
*PaperDimension w288h144/4 x 2 in: "288 144"
*PaperDimension w288h432/4 x 6 in: "288 432"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: Default
*Darkness Default/Printer Default: "<</cupsCompression -1>>setpagedevice"
*Darkness Light/Light: "<</cupsCompression 10>>setpagedevice"
*Darkness Dark/Dark: "<</cupsCompression 25>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Darkness
*% End of label-zpl.ppd
